{"version":1,"content":"<p>內地女星趙麗穎自2021年離婚後一直專心事業，不過之前她被指避開陳曉，轉搭劉昊然合作古裝大劇《九重天》。</p><p>而她與劉昊然近日卻被拍到先後現身同一家按摩店，但因「全程前後腳，更完全沒有同框」而引發熱議。</p><p>當日趙麗穎身穿淺色上衣，劉昊然則以藍色外套、</p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T16:20:24.603909+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":122,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T16:01:05+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:11.114435+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T16:18:11.114435+00:00","content_hash":"3712d3ad0c0d1edeb80567dbcaab7a49404dc2fa844b4fe7dade7d065a3cf38f","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}